## What ${BRAND_NAME} Is

${BRAND_NAME} is a multi-niche short-form social media content engine. One idea becomes platform-native posts for X, TikTok, Instagram, and Threads, for every niche in the `niches:` list, every week. Day-1 niche: ${NICHE_SLUG}.

9 agents. 3 teams. No sub-projects.

## Hierarchy

${BRAND_NAME} is the company. Teams and agents live at company level. Niches are declared in this file's `niches:` frontmatter list. Adding a niche is additive: no agent changes, no team changes.

- **Discovery team**: strategist, scout, researcher, librarian
- **Production team**: editor, writer
- **Operations team**: scheduler, analyst

## Active Niches

Each slug in `niches:` MUST correspond to: (1) a `skills/<slug>-niche-profile/SKILL.md`, (2) a `<niche>` schema in `${BRAND_SLUG}-kb`, and (3) a `.evidence/knowledge/<niche>/` directory. Day-1 niche: `${NICHE_SLUG}` (see `[[${NICHE_SLUG}-niche-profile]]`).

## Skill Bindings

All tasks inherit: `[[${NICHE_SLUG}-niche-profile]]`, `[[compliance-rules]]`, `[[brand-voice-system]]`, `[[audience-profiles]]`, `[[hooks-library]]`, `[[repurpose-engine]]`, `[[content-calendar]]`, `[[content-types]]`, `[[x-playbook]]`, `[[tiktok-playbook]]`, `[[instagram-playbook]]`, `[[threads-playbook]]`, `[[knowledge-base]]`, `[[x-posts-adapter]]`, `[[web-article-adapter]]`, `[[clippings-adapter]]`, `[[knowledge-compiler]]`, `[[knowledge-query]]`, `[[knowledge-lint]]`, `[[ai-tells]]`.

## Data Scope

Knowledge base: `${BRAND_SLUG}-kb` Postgres DB, schema per niche. Agents never hold DB credentials. Scripts project DB rows to `.evidence/knowledge/<niche>/` markdown files. Agents read files only.

## Compliance Posture

${BRAND_NAME} operates as a third-party independent creator. Not affiliated with any niche subject.

- Never auto-publish. Human gate is mandatory for regulated content.
- Not-financial-advice boilerplate on every regulated post (if applicable).
- No price predictions or buy/sell signals (if applicable).
- FTC, FCA, MiCA disclosure templates per platform (if applicable).
- Editor runs a 10-item compliance checklist on every regulated-topic draft.

## Success Metrics

Per-niche per-platform engagement benchmarks (vs pre-sprint baseline). Compliance violation count: target 0. Knowledge-base freshness: intelligence-seed refreshed every Friday.

## Add-a-Niche (Short Version)

1. SQL migration to add `<niche>` schema in `${BRAND_SLUG}-kb`
2. Create `skills/<niche>-niche-profile/SKILL.md` with `knowledge_sources:` block
3. Append slug to `COMPANY.md:niches` list (this file)
4. Run adapter scripts for the new niche
5. Run intelligence-seed task

Agents need no changes. Niches are additive.
